# SQLite database — never commit. It lives in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Jobnet\ at runtime; these patterns
# keep a stray copy out of the repo. The config table holds live API keys (Gemini, Groq, Google
# CSE, Brave) alongside resume text, generated cover letters, and the full applied/interest
# history. Schema belongs in Data/Migrations/, not in a committed binary.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.bak

